msgid "Author (human or agentic)"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-change.bpmn:87
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Before Ready for merge. Reads: the change set's Disposition (change set), each comment's Blue Disposition on Review Public Comments, the PR's diff at its head commit, and the staging QA report. Checks that every comment number has one disposition; that each agrees with the people's Blue Disposition; that each Accepted or Partially accepted comment has its change in the diff, and a Not accepted, Noted, Deferred, Duplicate or Out of scope one has none; that the diff changes nothing no disposition accounts for; and that the QA report for the staged commit has no failing gate. Writes: QA gate (change set), first line \"Passed <head sha>: …\" or \"Failed <head sha>: <why>\", and QA report (change set), the report's link. The sheet shows both under Staging review; a pass for an older commit reads as stale."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-change.bpmn:32
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Called by Process_PublicComment (CallActivity_MakeChange) once the editor's decision on a comment changes the document. An author makes the edit on a feature branch, the change set is reviewed on its staging preview as any content change (Process_ContentChangeReview), an independent QA gate checks the dispositions against the pull request, and each comment the change set answers is marked incorporated when it merges. Skill: public-comment."
msgstr ""

