msgid "Review the change set on its staging preview"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-change.bpmn:78
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The content-change review of the author's branch: its PR lists the PC refs it answers, and its staging preview is the after side of every deep link. A change the reviewers send back returns to the author inside that process."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-change.bpmn:64
#. Diagram label
msgid "The editor's decision changes the document"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-change.bpmn:52
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Where the author's edit is reviewed and lands: the feature branch's staging preview gives before/after deep links to each comment's anchor, the change set is reviewed as any content change, and each comment it answers is marked incorporated when it merges."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/public-comment-change.bpmn:58
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Whoever runs the QA gate: an agent session that did not author the change set, or a person; never the author's own session. Writes only QA gate (change set) and QA report (change set) on Agent - Change Sets."
msgstr ""
